[00:00.65]You are my sunshine, my only sunshine
{"你是我的阳光　我唯一的阳光"}
[00:06.13]You make me happy when skies are gray
{"当天空灰暗时　是你让我快乐"}
[00:12.48]You'll never know dear, how much I love you
{"亲爱的你永远不会知道　我有多爱你"}
[00:18.92]Please don't take my sunshine away
{"请别带走我的阳光"}
[00:25.82]The other night dear, as I lay sleeping
{"前几天的夜晚　亲爱的当我熟睡时"}
[00:31.68]I dreamed I held you in my arms
{"我梦见将你拥入怀中"}
[00:38.33]when I awoke, dear, I was mistaken
{"当我醒来时　亲爱的才发现是场误会"}
[00:44.28]So I hung my head and I cried
{"于是我低头哭泣"}
